Ephesians chapter 6 verse 17

"Take the helmet of salvation and the sword of the Spirit, which is the word of God"

Those words, authored by God, were written by the Apostle Paul during his imprisonment in Rome to the church in Ephesus to equip them for spiritual warfare


We are here together to train in becoming capable and dangerous soldiers of Christ Jesus

We wear the full armor of God, and we train the blade so we can wield the sword of the spirit with precision and strength



